WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.267
The Ukrainian government says

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.602
its forces are gaining momentum

00:00:02.602 --> 00:00:03.303
and taking back

00:00:03.303 --> 00:00:05.305
territory amid fierce fighting along

00:00:05.305 --> 00:00:07.307
the south and eastern front lines.

00:00:07.774 --> 00:00:08.908
Key claims its troops

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:10.744
have recaptured a string of Russian

00:00:10.744 --> 00:00:11.745
occupied villages

00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:13.279
along the Donetsk separates

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:14.981
your region border.

00:00:14.981 --> 00:00:16.449
Fred Pleitgen joins us now

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:17.851
live from Zachary.

00:00:17.851 --> 00:00:19.319
Fred, good to have you with us.

00:00:19.319 --> 00:00:20.520
How are we managed to verify

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.288
just what's been recaptured

00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:23.790
by the Ukrainian authorities

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:24.557
and the forces,

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:28.161
or is it just their word for now?

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:29.462
Well, there are certain areas

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:31.231
that we have actually been able to verify

00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:32.198
or at least geo locate

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:33.299
where those areas are.

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:34.267
But we've seen some videos

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:35.835
of Ukrainian troops marching

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:37.003
or going into villages,

00:00:37.003 --> 00:00:38.471
going into buildings in some villages

00:00:38.471 --> 00:00:40.140
and raising the Ukrainian flag.

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:40.607
And a lot of that,

00:00:40.607 --> 00:00:41.975
Julia, seems to be happening

00:00:41.975 --> 00:00:43.610
in the sort of southeastern

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:44.644
part of the front

00:00:44.644 --> 00:00:45.612
from where
a lot of those

00:00:45.612 --> 00:00:46.880
offensive actions

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.181
of the Ukrainian military

00:00:48.181 --> 00:00:49.449
have been taking place.

00:00:49.449 --> 00:00:50.417
And what we've heard

00:00:50.417 --> 00:00:51.518
is that
they're sort of marching

00:00:51.518 --> 00:00:53.086
southward from those areas,

00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:54.454
apparently trying to break through

00:00:54.454 --> 00:00:55.622
Russian defenses.

00:00:55.622 --> 00:00:56.089
Quite interesting.

00:00:56.089 --> 00:00:57.791
We haven't really heard anything yet

00:00:57.791 --> 00:00:59.025
from officially

00:00:59.025 --> 00:01:00.326
from the Russian defense ministry.

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:01.194
But there's Russian

00:01:01.194 --> 00:01:02.595
military bloggers

00:01:02.595 --> 00:01:03.496
who usually are very

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:05.231
well informed, who talk directly

00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:06.166
to Russian units,

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:07.500
who say that they are quite concerned

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:08.568
about the situation

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:10.370
on that part of the front line.

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:12.505
And they also say that in that area,

00:01:12.505 --> 00:01:14.174
the Ukrainians are advancing.

00:01:14.174 --> 00:01:15.008
Nevertheless,

00:01:15.008 --> 00:01:15.842
there do seem to be

00:01:15.842 --> 00:01:17.110
some significant losses

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:19.345
also on the part of the Ukrainians.

00:01:19.345 --> 00:01:21.047
The front line is, of course, very long.

00:01:21.047 --> 00:01:22.982
And in some places, the Ukrainians,

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:24.317
the Russians have said

00:01:24.317 --> 00:01:25.185
that they have been able

00:01:25.185 --> 00:01:27.187
to hold Ukrainian advances up

00:01:27.187 --> 00:01:27.987
and destroy

00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:28.788
a lot of armor,

00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:30.924
including Western donated armor,

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:31.724
speaking about

00:01:31.724 --> 00:01:32.792
leopard to main

00:01:32.792 --> 00:01:33.460
battle tanks

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:34.561
provided by the Germans,

00:01:34.561 --> 00:01:35.728
but also, for instance,

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:37.797
open source intelligence indicates

00:01:37.797 --> 00:01:39.766
some 16 Bradley Infantry

00:01:39.766 --> 00:01:41.334
fighting vehicles, of course, provided

00:01:41.334 --> 00:01:42.702
by the United States.

00:01:42.702 --> 00:01:44.737
That's a large chunk of the vehicles

00:01:44.737 --> 00:01:45.338
that the Ukrainians

00:01:45.338 --> 00:01:46.673
got from the from the U.S.

00:01:46.673 --> 00:01:48.141
So it seems as though

00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:49.909
the Ukrainians are making gains,

00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:50.944
but those gains certainly

00:01:50.944 --> 00:01:52.145
are coming at a price.

00:01:52.145 --> 00:01:52.645
And,

00:01:52.745 --> 00:01:53.847
you know, the big question on the ground,

00:01:53.847 --> 00:01:54.514
of course, has been

00:01:54.514 --> 00:01:54.981
whether or not

00:01:54.981 --> 00:01:57.183
this is really the big counter offensive

00:01:57.183 --> 00:01:57.984
that the Ukrainians

00:01:57.984 --> 00:01:58.852
have been talking about.

00:01:58.852 --> 00:02:00.920
Certainly
there were some indications

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:02.989
by the Ukrainian president this weekend.

00:02:03.022 --> 00:02:03.590
However,

00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:04.624
there was also a video

00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:05.892
that was put out by the head

00:02:05.892 --> 00:02:06.826
of the Defense

00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:08.862
Intelligence Agency here of this country

00:02:08.862 --> 00:02:10.597
where he was just sitting in his chair

00:02:10.597 --> 00:02:11.564
for several seconds.

00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:12.932
And then a sort of writing

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:13.967
came on the screen saying,

00:02:13.967 --> 00:02:15.335
plans, love, silence.

00:02:15.335 --> 00:02:17.303
So the Ukrainians continuing to say

00:02:17.303 --> 00:02:18.671
if this is the big offensive,

00:02:18.671 --> 00:02:19.339
they certainly aren't

00:02:19.339 --> 00:02:20.807
willing to talk about it.

00:02:20.807 --> 00:02:22.876
But it is pretty clear, Julia, that along

00:02:23.076 --> 00:02:24.177
pretty much the entire

00:02:24.177 --> 00:02:26.112
front line here in Ukraine,

00:02:26.112 --> 00:02:27.914
the Ukrainians have the initiative,

00:02:27.914 --> 00:02:28.715
while the Russians aren't

00:02:28.715 --> 00:02:30.817
making any gains really significantly

00:02:30.817 --> 00:02:32.852
in any areas that we can see.

00:02:33.153 --> 00:02:34.621
If we look, for instance, at Bamford,

00:02:34.621 --> 00:02:35.688
which of course, is a town

00:02:35.688 --> 00:02:36.923
that has seen a great deal

00:02:36.923 --> 00:02:38.057
of fighting over the past

00:02:38.057 --> 00:02:38.958
couple of months,

00:02:38.958 --> 00:02:40.560
there are also the Ukrainians

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:41.127
right now

00:02:41.127 --> 00:02:42.462
are saying that they are the ones

00:02:42.462 --> 00:02:43.563
who are making significant

00:02:43.563 --> 00:02:44.931
gains on the battlefield

00:02:44.931 --> 00:02:45.465
while the Russians

00:02:45.465 --> 00:02:47.634
are the ones who are pulling back. Julia.

00:02:47.634 --> 00:02:48.334
But to your point,

00:02:48.334 --> 00:02:49.235
certainly the Ukrainians

00:02:49.235 --> 00:02:50.837
not giving any further information

00:02:50.837 --> 00:02:53.306
about away about what's going on.

00:02:53.306 --> 00:02:54.407
Fred Pleitgen there in south

00:02:54.407 --> 00:02:55.441
Russia for us, thank you

00:02:59.279 --> 00:03:00.480
Ukraine says Russia

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:01.447
is on the defensive

00:03:01.447 --> 00:03:03.449
when it comes to fighting around Zakariya

00:03:03.449 --> 00:03:04.250
and her son.

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:04.951
This comes

00:03:04.951 --> 00:03:05.585
as Ukrainian

00:03:05.585 --> 00:03:06.219
armed forces

00:03:06.219 --> 00:03:07.320
liberated villages

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:09.389
along the eastern front lines.

00:03:09.389 --> 00:03:10.957
Ukraine's deputy defense minister

00:03:10.957 --> 00:03:12.659
says three villages in the Donetsk

00:03:12.659 --> 00:03:14.594
region have been recaptured.

00:03:14.594 --> 00:03:15.361
And Russian

00:03:15.361 --> 00:03:16.696
military bloggers are warning

00:03:16.696 --> 00:03:17.697
its forces

00:03:17.697 --> 00:03:19.265
should, quote, expect the pressure

00:03:19.265 --> 00:03:20.767
to intensify soon.

00:03:20.767 --> 00:03:22.502
Meanwhile, Ukrainian officials say water

00:03:22.502 --> 00:03:24.404
levels are receding in parts

00:03:24.404 --> 00:03:26.439
of a neat pro rivers, West Bank.

00:03:26.439 --> 00:03:27.640
But nearly 50

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.509
settlements are still flooded.

00:03:29.509 --> 00:03:30.476
It's been nearly a week

00:03:30.476 --> 00:03:33.780
since the Nova Kovar backed dam

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:35.748
collapsed, unleashing a torrent of water

00:03:35.748 --> 00:03:37.083
into surrounding areas.

00:03:37.083 --> 00:03:37.684
Clare Sebastian

00:03:37.684 --> 00:03:38.251
joins us now

00:03:38.251 --> 00:03:39.752
to discuss these stories

00:03:39.752 --> 00:03:42.522
that obviously Ukraine is keen to garner

00:03:42.589 --> 00:03:44.457
momentum and early successes

00:03:44.457 --> 00:03:45.592
in this counteroffensive.

00:03:45.592 --> 00:03:47.327
We're hearing about three villages

00:03:47.327 --> 00:03:48.761
being liberated.

00:03:48.761 --> 00:03:49.128
Obviously,

00:03:49.128 --> 00:03:51.097
this extreme operational silence

00:03:51.097 --> 00:03:52.899
from key, though, about the future plans.

00:03:52.899 --> 00:03:54.701
What do we know at this stage?

00:03:54.701 --> 00:03:55.335
Well,
I think all

00:03:55.335 --> 00:03:55.868
we can tell

00:03:55.868 --> 00:03:57.370
from the location of these villages

00:03:57.370 --> 00:03:59.339
is that it could potentially fit

00:03:59.339 --> 00:03:59.906
with the strategy

00:03:59.906 --> 00:04:00.840
that we've been discussing now

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:01.741
for several weeks,

00:04:01.741 --> 00:04:03.176
if not months of essentially.

00:04:03.176 --> 00:04:04.210
And if we can pull up the map again

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:05.144
to show it.

00:04:05.144 --> 00:04:06.980
But cutting in half Russia's

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:07.947
gains so far.

00:04:07.947 --> 00:04:10.316
And if you look at where that is, just

00:04:10.316 --> 00:04:11.384
just at the top of that

00:04:11.384 --> 00:04:12.986
front line by Russia

00:04:12.986 --> 00:04:14.320
occupies in the red there.

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:15.455
That is really the narrowest

00:04:15.455 --> 00:04:16.689
strip linking Ukrainian

00:04:16.689 --> 00:04:17.590
controlled territory

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:18.758
with the Sea of Azov.

00:04:18.758 --> 00:04:20.260
So possibly

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:21.394
fits with that strategy

00:04:21.394 --> 00:04:23.563
of cutting off the land bridge to Crimea.

00:04:23.596 --> 00:04:24.497
I think the other thing to bear in

00:04:24.497 --> 00:04:24.897
mind here

00:04:24.897 --> 00:04:25.865
is it's
not just there

00:04:25.865 --> 00:04:26.799
what we're seeing fighting

00:04:26.799 --> 00:04:27.634
with the pockets

00:04:27.634 --> 00:04:28.868
of fighting around Bermuda.

00:04:28.868 --> 00:04:29.869
There's evidence further up,

00:04:29.869 --> 00:04:30.803
even experience,

00:04:30.803 --> 00:04:31.404
which is pretty much

00:04:31.404 --> 00:04:32.739
the northernmost part

00:04:32.739 --> 00:04:33.940
of the eastern front line.

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:34.307
Either

00:04:34.307 --> 00:04:35.708
they're keeping them guessing

00:04:35.708 --> 00:04:36.376
or perhaps there's

00:04:36.376 --> 00:04:38.211
still some probing activity.

00:04:38.211 --> 00:04:40.013
But I think that is key to understand.

00:04:40.013 --> 00:04:41.247
This isn't as of now

00:04:41.247 --> 00:04:42.682
a localized counter-offensive

00:04:42.682 --> 00:04:44.017
like we saw in the Kiev

00:04:44.017 --> 00:04:45.752
region in the spring of 20, 22,

00:04:45.752 --> 00:04:47.820
like we saw in Harkis last autumn.

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:49.989
It's over a widespread area.

00:04:49.989 --> 00:04:50.823
But this is hard.

00:04:50.823 --> 00:04:52.525
This is a hard fight for Ukraine.

00:04:52.525 --> 00:04:53.826
We're hearing from Open-Source

00:04:53.826 --> 00:04:54.560
intelligence firm,

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:55.928
a Dutch one called Oryx,

00:04:55.928 --> 00:04:56.963
that they've lost

00:04:56.963 --> 00:04:58.765
16 US supply downed

00:04:58.765 --> 00:04:59.632
vehicles Bradleys

00:04:59.632 --> 00:05:00.867
in the last several days.

00:05:00.867 --> 00:05:02.368
They say that's about 15%

00:05:02.368 --> 00:05:04.437
of what the US is supplied in total

00:05:04.437 --> 00:05:05.571
in terms of those Bradleys.

00:05:05.571 --> 00:05:06.472
Russia has overall,

00:05:06.472 --> 00:05:07.240
according to the firm,

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:08.641
lost much more equipment

00:05:08.641 --> 00:05:09.709
over the course of this war.

00:05:09.709 --> 00:05:10.843
But Russia is making

00:05:10.843 --> 00:05:12.378
a lot of these attacks

00:05:12.378 --> 00:05:13.713
on Western equipment

00:05:13.713 --> 00:05:14.380
and Ukrainian

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:15.348
strongholds of equipment

00:05:15.348 --> 00:05:16.883
and forces in general.

00:05:16.883 --> 00:05:17.850
So, you know,

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:18.985
military analysts will tell you

00:05:18.985 --> 00:05:20.620
much harder to attack than defend,

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:22.155
certainly in terms of losses

00:05:22.155 --> 00:05:23.890
And in President Zelensky's

00:05:23.890 --> 00:05:25.325
Sunday night address,

00:05:25.325 --> 00:05:25.958
he said that

00:05:25.958 --> 00:05:27.593
the ICC has begun

00:05:27.593 --> 00:05:30.096
its probe of the disaster.

00:05:30.096 --> 00:05:31.497
What will that involve

00:05:31.497 --> 00:05:32.365
Yeah, we don't know yet.

00:05:32.365 --> 00:05:33.366
We haven't been on to confirm this

00:05:33.366 --> 00:05:35.101
with the ICC itself.

00:05:35.101 --> 00:05:36.803
But but Zelensky is saying

00:05:36.803 --> 00:05:38.738
that this was on the request of Ukraine

00:05:38.738 --> 00:05:39.939
by the prosecutor's office

00:05:39.939 --> 00:05:41.207
that officials have already visited

00:05:41.207 --> 00:05:42.175
the site.

00:05:42.175 --> 00:05:43.142
We need to try to understand

00:05:43.142 --> 00:05:43.810
what the parameters

00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:44.711
of the investigation are,

00:05:44.711 --> 00:05:46.312
whether it's a war crimes investigation.

00:05:46.312 --> 00:05:48.648
We know that the Geneva Convention covers

00:05:49.282 --> 00:05:51.084
the destruction of installations

00:05:51.084 --> 00:05:52.852
that unleash damaging forces.

00:05:52.852 --> 00:05:54.654
They feel that can include them.

00:05:54.654 --> 00:05:55.421
So that might

00:05:55.421 --> 00:05:56.322
be part of the investigation,

00:05:56.322 --> 00:05:57.323
but we don't know yet.

00:05:57.323 --> 00:05:58.825
Meanwhile, as you say, a week on,

00:05:58.825 --> 00:06:00.193
they're still doing rescue efforts.

00:06:00.193 --> 00:06:01.894
Thousands of people have been evacuated.

00:06:01.894 --> 00:06:02.729
Ukraine has even,

00:06:02.729 --> 00:06:03.830
as even said, it's evacuated

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:04.630
more than 100 people

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:05.665
from the Russian

00:06:05.665 --> 00:06:06.032
side,

00:06:06.032 --> 00:06:07.533
the Russian occupied side of the

00:06:07.533 --> 00:06:07.967
river, and,

00:06:07.967 --> 00:06:09.635
of course, the environmental catastrophe

00:06:09.635 --> 00:06:10.536
still unfolding.

00:06:10.536 --> 00:06:11.304
ClassPass Bastion,

00:06:11.304 --> 00:06:12.305
as always, thank you so much.

